                } else {
                    print("Leaves in " + next.getPatience() + " s");
                }
                ```

entries.en:
The customer waiting at the register whose screen the robot stands at; `null` if the robot isn't at a screen or nobody waits there. You can ask whether they're an adult: `customer.isAdult()`, since children can't be sold alcohol or cigarettes. The order itself is taken by `robot.takeOrder()`.

```
Customer customer = robot.getCustomer();
if (customer != null) {
    print(customer.isAdult() ? "Adult" : "Child");
}
```

